# Hoard on an Obsidian vault: a note with properties, a callout, links
# shown as their words, a section embedded from another note and a notes
# block listing the garden's open todos, which keeps up as one is added.
# command: greed notes
# needs: notes
size 1280 800
fps 30
typing 0.03
show-keys
hide
wait-for Agenda
type Summer project
wait-for Notes that match
keys up enter
wait-for Start early
wait 1
show

caption A note from an Obsidian vault: properties, a callout, links as their words
wait 3

caption A section of another note, embedded and kept current
wait 2.5

caption A notes block lists the garden's open todos, and keeps up
keys ctrl-end
type - [ ] stake the tomatoes due:2026-10-23
wait-for stake the tomatoes
wait 4
shot obsidian
wait 0.5
